w: San-ctus, (*) san-ctus, san-ctus Dó-mi-nus De-us Sá-ba-oth. Ple-ni sunt cae-li et ter-ra gló-ri-a tu-a. Ho-sán-na in ex-cél-sis! Be-ne-dí-ctus, qui ve-nit in nó-mi-ne Dó-mi-ni. Ho-sán-na in ex-cél-sis!
